      "claim": "Because salmon (whether native or introduced) either do not occur in the Caspian Sea or, if present, spawn only in freshwater tributaries, no salmon perform mating/spawning within the open waters of the Caspian Sea.",
      "evidence": "Logical combination of steps 2, 4, and 5: spawning requires freshwater, and there are no salmon that spawn in the sea itself.",
